description:
Romeow is a minimalist and charming puzzle game about a kitten who is too young to find the way by itself. He is just a kitten, he feels lost when he is without his favorite toy. Go through the messy paths and take Romeow 's wool back so he can sleep in his cozy bed.

• 40 hand-crafted levels with increasing complexity;

• No score, no timer and no pressure;

• Pleasant sound track;

• Lovely art style.
Messy paths
